Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 690 "Collecting Mana Pieces III"
    Journal for karus "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Aldos."
    Collect 5 of 389750000

Requires player level >= 68 and quest 689 is completed

Rewards
    Give 10000000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "I feel like [Chief Researcher] Gaz is going to need you. Let's go to Islant."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I feel like [Chief Researcher] Aldos is going to need you. Let's go to Islant."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "What a coincidence! I was just about to ask for you."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Let's see ...next I need [Bitter mana piece]. As you can expect, you can get it from [Apostle of Piercing Cold]. It is a magical creature that uses the cold magic. Please go get it.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Gaz from Eslant has requested to get some [Bitter mana piece] from the [Apostle of Piercing Cold]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "What a coincidence! I was just about to ask for you."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Let's see ...next I need [Bitter mana piece]. As you can expect, you can get it from [Apostle of Piercing Cold]. It is a magical creature that uses the cold magic. Please go get it.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Aldos from Eslant has requested to get some [Bitter mana piece] from the [Apostle of Piercing Cold]."

On in_progress
    Say "[Bitter mana piece] from the [Apostle of Piercing Cold]...are they called [Apostle of Piercing Cold] because they give you [Bitter mana piece]? Kekeke...it's just too funny. By the way, what are you doing here?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Just looking at it makes me cold. Please give it to me fast.\n\nSo this is going to be the last one. It will be pretty tough this time. It's the [Apostle of the Storm], a magical creature that uses storm magic. Please get the [Wild mana piece] which carries their energy."

On completed
    Say "Please come back to me when you reach Lv69. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
